Z||000000||85 gt fiero||10-20-2001||12:32 AM||||I know there has been a lot of talk about lamborghini, and ferrai body kits for fieros, i know they look sweet and everything, but doesn't that take away the "fiero" from the car, whats sweet about the fiero is that there is nothing else like it, it is an original, i dont quite understand these lambo and ferrai body kits, these factories put a lot of work into making them sweet, and then a company comes out with a replica for a fraction of the cost, but if the body kit is something that you manufactured yourself like archie for instance then it really looks nice. but this is just my opinion so i may be way wrong <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  Randy<P>------------------<BR>RALLY CAR, FULL ROLL CAGE, SKID PLATES AND SOON TO BE BRIGHT YELLOW||||reg||12
